1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:05,224
Iss course ka har language
model ek web API ke peeche rehta hai.

2
00:00:05,444 --> 00:00:10,080
Aap ek HTTP request bhejte ho,
aur jawaab ka intezaar karte ho.

3
00:00:10,299 --> 00:00:16,571
Yeh lesson aapko teen tools deta hai jo
isse achhe se karte hain: type hints, httpx

4
00:00:16,571 --> 00:00:19,140
se HTTP requests, aur async await.

5
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:25,519
Iss lesson ke baad aap functions par
type hints lagaoge, aur unhe type checker se

6
00:00:25,519 --> 00:00:26,334
check karoge.

7
00:00:26,684 --> 00:00:30,669
HTTP requests, responses,
aur status codes samjhoge.

8
00:00:31,019 --> 00:00:36,181
httpx se web APIs call karoge,
timeout aur error handling ke saath.

9
00:00:36,531 --> 00:00:39,898
Aur async await se dheemi
cheezein ek saath chalaoge.

10
00:00:41,198 --> 00:00:42,995
Pehle what: type hint kya hai?

11
00:00:43,215 --> 00:00:47,814
Courier ka dabba socho, jis par
likha hai: fragile, do kilo, electronics.

12
00:00:48,034 --> 00:00:50,296
Label andar ki cheez nahi badalta.

13
00:00:50,516 --> 00:00:56,006
Lekin sabko pata hota hai kya umeed
karni hai, aur scanner bhejne se pehle hi galti

14
00:00:56,006 --> 00:00:57,064
pakad sakta hai.

15
00:00:57,284 --> 00:00:59,686
Type hint label hai, aur mypy scanner.

16
00:01:00,986 --> 00:01:06,255
Har parameter ke baad colon aur type
likhte ho, aur brackets ke baad ek arrow aur

17
00:01:06,255 --> 00:01:07,035
return type.

18
00:01:07,255 --> 00:01:11,032
Yeh function floats ki list
leta hai aur ek float lautaata hai.

19
00:01:11,382 --> 00:01:16,324
Yahan dictionary strings se floats tak
map karti hai, aur khadi line ka matlab hai

20
00:01:16,324 --> 00:01:16,505
ya.

21
00:01:16,725 --> 00:01:20,200
Function float lautaata
hai, ya None, jab model na mile.

22
00:01:20,550 --> 00:01:23,299
Sahi tarah call karo,
toh sab theek chalta hai.

23
00:01:23,649 --> 00:01:25,250
Lekin important baat.

24
00:01:25,470 --> 00:01:28,129
Python chalte waqt hints check nahi karta.

25
00:01:28,349 --> 00:01:33,053
String pass karna allowed hai, aur crash
function ke andar kahin gehraai mein hota

26
00:01:33,053 --> 00:01:33,282
hai.

27
00:01:34,582 --> 00:01:40,130
Chalao: do sahi results, aur phir sum
ke andar se ek ulajhne wala TypeError, asli

28
00:01:40,130 --> 00:01:41,500
galti se bahut door.

29
00:01:41,850 --> 00:01:47,482
mypy jaisa type checker code chalaye bina
aapke hints padhta hai, aur galat argument

30
00:01:47,482 --> 00:01:50,901
wali exact line bata
deta hai, chalane se pehle hi.

31
00:01:51,121 --> 00:01:55,255
Aapka editor bhi yahi hints
autocomplete ke liye use karta hai.

32
00:01:56,555 --> 00:01:59,381
Simple types: str, int, float, aur bool.

33
00:01:59,731 --> 00:02:04,684
Collections batate hain ki andar kya
hai: strings ki list, ya strings se ints tak

34
00:02:04,684 --> 00:02:05,357
dictionary.

35
00:02:05,707 --> 00:02:09,647
None ke saath khadi line ka
matlab: value missing ho sakti hai.

36
00:02:09,997 --> 00:02:14,071
Tuple hint har position batata
hai, jaise ek string aur ek int.

37
00:02:14,421 --> 00:02:19,996
Module teen mein Pydantic naam ki
library inhi hints se asli data ko chalte waqt

38
00:02:19,996 --> 00:02:21,111
validate karegi.

39
00:02:21,331 --> 00:02:24,000
Wahan hints sach mein
taakatwar ban jaate hain.

40
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:26,648
Ab HTTP.

41
00:02:26,868 --> 00:02:28,654
Restaurant mein order socho.

42
00:02:28,874 --> 00:02:32,535
Aap client ho, waiter ko
order dete ho, yahi request hai.

43
00:02:32,755 --> 00:02:34,037
Kitchen server hai.

44
00:02:34,257 --> 00:02:38,783
Woh plate ke saath ek note bhejta
hai: serve ho gaya, ya khatam ho gaya.

45
00:02:39,003 --> 00:02:41,168
Yahi response aur status code hai.

46
00:02:42,468 --> 00:02:47,575
HTTP web APIs ki bhaasha hai, aur
yeh jitna lagta hai usse aasaan hai.

47
00:02:47,925 --> 00:02:48,957
Do side hain.

48
00:02:49,177 --> 00:02:51,281
Client, yaani aapka Python code.

49
00:02:51,501 --> 00:02:54,620
Aur server, jaise
kisi model provider ki API.

50
00:02:54,970 --> 00:02:56,774
Client request bhejta hai.

51
00:02:56,994 --> 00:03:02,219
Usme ek method hota hai, jaise GET
padhne ke liye, ya POST data bhejne ke liye.

52
00:03:02,439 --> 00:03:08,685
Ek URL, headers jinme extra jaankaari
hoti hai jaise aapki API key, aur kabhi kabhi

53
00:03:08,685 --> 00:03:09,287
ek body.

54
00:03:09,637 --> 00:03:14,730
Server response wapas bhejta hai: ek
status code jo batata hai kaam kaisa raha,

55
00:03:14,730 --> 00:03:15,891
headers, aur body.

56
00:03:16,111 --> 00:03:19,975
AI APIs ki body
lagbhag hamesha JSON hoti hai.

57
00:03:21,275 --> 00:03:23,696
Do sau wale codes ka matlab success.

58
00:03:23,916 --> 00:03:27,163
Two hundred OK hai, two
zero one matlab created.

59
00:03:27,513 --> 00:03:30,800
Chaar sau wale codes ka
matlab galti aapki taraf hai.

60
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:35,701
Galat input, galat ya missing
API key, ya aisa URL jo hai hi nahi.

61
00:03:35,921 --> 00:03:37,779
Retry se kuch nahi hoga.

62
00:03:37,999 --> 00:03:39,518
Request theek karo.

63
00:03:39,868 --> 00:03:42,125
Four twenty nine ka apna card hai.

64
00:03:42,345 --> 00:03:44,733
Matlab aap rate limit tak pahunch gaye.

65
00:03:44,953 --> 00:03:50,495
Har model API mein yeh hoti hai, aur
Module do mein sahi tareeke se ruk kar retry

66
00:03:50,495 --> 00:03:51,521
karna seekhoge.

67
00:03:51,871 --> 00:03:55,181
Aur paanch sau wale codes ka
matlab server mein problem hai.

68
00:03:55,401 --> 00:04:00,149
Yeh aksar thodi der ki hoti hai, toh
dhyaan se kiya retry kaam kar sakta hai.

69
00:04:01,449 --> 00:04:02,896
Ab asli requests.

70
00:04:03,116 --> 00:04:08,556
Taaki yeh offline bhi chale, project ka
sample data ek chhote local web server se

71
00:04:08,556 --> 00:04:12,384
serve ho raha hai, Python
ke built in http dot server se.

72
00:04:12,604 --> 00:04:14,321
Koi bahari service nahi.

73
00:04:14,671 --> 00:04:20,095
httpx dot get ek GET request
bhejta hai aur response object deta hai.

74
00:04:20,315 --> 00:04:21,824
Timeout hamesha do.

75
00:04:22,044 --> 00:04:26,038
Hamesha ke liye atki network
call aapke agent ko jama degi.

76
00:04:26,258 --> 00:04:30,977
Response status code aur content
type batata hai: two hundred, aur JSON.

77
00:04:31,327 --> 00:04:36,585
raise for status har error status ko
exception bana deta hai, taaki failure chupke

78
00:04:36,585 --> 00:04:37,739
se na nikal jaaye.

79
00:04:37,959 --> 00:04:41,993
Phir dot json body ko Python
objects mein parse karta hai.

80
00:04:42,213 --> 00:04:43,365
Das records.

81
00:04:43,715 --> 00:04:46,280
Aur yahan ek aisi
file maangi jo hai hi nahi.

82
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:50,976
HTTPStatusError pakad kar
status code padha: four zero four.

83
00:04:52,276 --> 00:04:53,518
Ab why async?

84
00:04:53,738 --> 00:04:59,129
Ek language model call mein kai second
lag sakte hain, aur uss dauraan aapka program

85
00:04:59,129 --> 00:05:01,311
bas network ka intezaar karta hai.

86
00:05:01,531 --> 00:05:07,098
Ek chai wale ko socho: woh teen cups ek
saath chadhata hai, ek ke ubalne ka intezaar

87
00:05:07,098 --> 00:05:09,086
karke doosra shuru nahi karta.

88
00:05:09,436 --> 00:05:14,783
Agar agent ko teen alag jawaab chahiye,
aur woh ek ek karke maange, toh intezaar

89
00:05:14,783 --> 00:05:15,852
judta jaata hai.

90
00:05:16,072 --> 00:05:18,730
Ek ek second ki teen calls, teen second.

91
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:24,197
Async ke saath teeno shuru karo, saath
mein intezaar karo, aur lagbhag ek second

92
00:05:24,197 --> 00:05:25,284
mein kaam khatam.

93
00:05:25,504 --> 00:05:27,425
Zyaada computing power nahi.

94
00:05:27,645 --> 00:05:29,896
Bas intezaar mein time barbaad nahi.

95
00:05:31,196 --> 00:05:36,344
async def ek coroutine banata hai,
yaani aisa function jo ruk sakta hai. await ka

96
00:05:36,344 --> 00:05:41,365
matlab: yahan ruko jab tak yeh khatam
na ho, aur tab tak doosra kaam chalne do.

97
00:05:41,365 --> 00:05:45,370
asyncio dot sleep yahan
network reply ke intezaar ki jagah hai.

98
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:50,506
Yeh version loop mein har call ko await
karta hai, toh woh phir bhi ek ke baad ek

99
00:05:50,506 --> 00:05:51,215
chalti hain.

100
00:05:51,565 --> 00:05:56,835
Yeh version teeno ko asyncio dot gather
ko deta hai, jo unhe ek saath chalata hai,

101
00:05:56,835 --> 00:06:01,333
aur results usi order mein
lautaata hai jis order mein unhe diya gaya.

102
00:06:01,683 --> 00:06:07,003
Aakhir mein asyncio dot run event loop
shuru karta hai, jo coroutines ko chalata

103
00:06:07,003 --> 00:06:07,269
hai.

104
00:06:07,489 --> 00:06:09,441
Dono versions ka time napa.

105
00:06:09,661 --> 00:06:13,885
Asli measurement: ek ek karke
teen second, ek saath ek second.

106
00:06:15,185 --> 00:06:20,922
httpx ka ek async client bhi hai. fetch
coroutine request ko await karta hai aur

107
00:06:20,922 --> 00:06:23,073
batata hai kitne records aaye.

108
00:06:23,423 --> 00:06:28,499
async with ek shared client kholta
hai, aur baad mein theek se band karta hai.

109
00:06:28,499 --> 00:06:30,711
gather har URL ek saath laata hai.

110
00:06:30,931 --> 00:06:35,295
Dono files ek saath download
hui: das records aur paanch records.

111
00:06:35,515 --> 00:06:38,903
Project ka fetch command
bilkul aise hi kaam karta hai.

112
00:06:40,203 --> 00:06:44,470
Async ke kuch niyam. await sirf
async function ke andar chalta hai.

113
00:06:44,820 --> 00:06:50,048
Event loop ek hi baar shuru karo,
program ke top par, asyncio dot run se.

114
00:06:50,398 --> 00:06:53,857
Async intezaar ko tez
karta hai, network ya disk ka.

115
00:06:54,077 --> 00:06:56,701
Bhaari calculations ko tez nahi karta.

116
00:06:58,001 --> 00:06:59,295
Interview corner.

117
00:06:59,515 --> 00:07:03,684
Pehla question: kya Python chalte
waqt type hints enforce karta hai?

118
00:07:06,034 --> 00:07:07,129
Answer: nahi.

119
00:07:07,349 --> 00:07:11,931
Hints tools ke liye hain, jaise mypy
aur editor, aur padhne walon ke liye.

120
00:07:12,151 --> 00:07:17,602
Pydantic jaisi libraries unhe padh kar
data validate karti hain, lekin plain Python

121
00:07:17,602 --> 00:07:19,047
unhe ignore karta hai.

122
00:07:19,267 --> 00:07:22,786
Trap: kehna ki hints khud
code ko tez ya safe banate hain.

123
00:07:23,136 --> 00:07:27,049
Doosra: kaunse HTTP
errors par retry karna chahiye?

124
00:07:29,399 --> 00:07:31,891
Answer: four twenty nine, thoda ruk kar.

125
00:07:32,111 --> 00:07:35,337
Paanch sau wale, jo
server ki temporary problem hain.

126
00:07:35,557 --> 00:07:36,635
Aur timeouts.

127
00:07:36,855 --> 00:07:38,632
Backoff aur limit ke saath.

128
00:07:38,852 --> 00:07:44,298
Chaar sau wale jaise four zero one ya
four zero four ka matlab request galat hai,

129
00:07:44,298 --> 00:07:45,912
retry se kuch nahi hoga.

130
00:07:46,132 --> 00:07:51,027
Trap: sab par jaldi jaldi retry
karna, jisse rate limit aur bigad jaati hai.

131
00:07:51,377 --> 00:07:53,486
Teesra: async kab sahi choice hai?

132
00:07:55,836 --> 00:08:01,191
Answer: jab kaam I O bound ho, yaani
bahut saare network ya disk ke intezaar ek

133
00:08:01,191 --> 00:08:02,885
saath, jaise model calls.

134
00:08:03,105 --> 00:08:06,537
Bhaari CPU ke kaam
mein async madad nahi karta.

135
00:08:06,757 --> 00:08:12,743
Trap: async function ke andar blocking
function chalana, jaise time dot sleep, ya

136
00:08:12,743 --> 00:08:13,999
normal httpx get.

137
00:08:14,219 --> 00:08:16,690
Woh baaki saare tasks ko rok deta hai.

138
00:08:17,990 --> 00:08:19,099
Practice time.

139
00:08:19,319 --> 00:08:21,733
Video pause karo, aur khud try karo.

140
00:08:22,083 --> 00:08:27,020
Pehla: lesson teen ke shorten
function par type hints lagao, aur mypy chalao.

141
00:08:27,370 --> 00:08:32,025
Doosra: http demo mein response
ka content length header print karo.

142
00:08:32,375 --> 00:08:36,375
Teesra: async demo ko paanch
tasks, do do second ke, bana do.

143
00:08:36,595 --> 00:08:38,547
Pehle dono times guess karo.

144
00:08:38,897 --> 00:08:42,761
Aur scenario: agent ko kabhi
kabhi four twenty nine milta hai.

145
00:08:42,981 --> 00:08:44,806
Ek safe retry plan batao.

146
00:08:52,106 --> 00:08:52,936
Quick check.

147
00:08:53,156 --> 00:08:55,868
API four twenty nine status deti hai.

148
00:08:56,088 --> 00:08:59,012
Matlab kya hai, aur
code ko kya karna chahiye?

149
00:09:04,712 --> 00:09:05,215
B.

150
00:09:05,435 --> 00:09:07,130
Bahut zyaada requests.

151
00:09:07,350 --> 00:09:10,226
Rate limit lag gayi,
toh ruko, phir retry karo.

152
00:09:10,446 --> 00:09:13,814
Module do mein backoff ke
saath yeh theek se banayenge.

153
00:09:15,114 --> 00:09:16,400
Doosra question.

154
00:09:16,620 --> 00:09:22,094
Teen alag calls, har ek do second ki.
asyncio gather lagbhag kitna time lega?

155
00:09:27,794 --> 00:09:29,435
B, lagbhag do second.

156
00:09:29,655 --> 00:09:31,736
Teeno saath mein intezaar karti hain.

157
00:09:31,956 --> 00:09:34,052
Ek ek karke chhe second lagte.

158
00:09:35,352 --> 00:09:36,077
Recap.

159
00:09:36,297 --> 00:09:41,216
Type hints aapka iraada likhte hain,
aur mypy chalane se pehle check karta hai.

160
00:09:41,566 --> 00:09:47,077
HTTP matlab request aur response, aur
status code batata hai kaam kaisa raha.

161
00:09:47,427 --> 00:09:50,937
httpx timeout ke
saath, aur raise for status.

162
00:09:51,287 --> 00:09:55,550
Aur bahut saari calls ka ek saath
intezaar: async, await, aur gather.

163
00:09:55,900 --> 00:09:59,052
Ab project ke liye har
Python skill aapke paas hai.

164
00:09:59,272 --> 00:10:03,068
Agle lesson mein Python AI
Toolkit banana shuru karenge.

165
00:10:04,368 --> 00:10:05,826
Lesson paanch complete.

166
00:10:06,046 --> 00:10:08,739
Ab aap web APIs se baat kar sakte ho.

167
00:10:08,959 --> 00:10:11,979
Milte hain agle lesson
mein, project ke saath.
